    "detailed_description": "Intiface Central provides free and easy access to over 300 different pieces of haptics and sensor hardware. Connect to games, VR, and interactive experiences using our open source API, with capabilities to work on Windows, macOS, and Linux, including SteamOS on the Steam Deck.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIntiface Central allows for multiple types of haptic actuation, including<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Vibration<br />\r\n- Rotation<br />\r\n- Linear movement<br />\r\n- Constriction/Inflation systems<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs well as sensor systems like<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Pressure<br />\r\n- Temperature<br />\r\n- Position<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand more!",
